{"id":"vod_jy_38115","vodId":"38115","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠·改","name_cn":"龙珠·改","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第98集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/fa84fbf5d2a071a938062b207cec7693.jpg"},"summary":"许多年前降临在贝吉塔行星上的灾难，无形中改变了整个宇宙的命运。经过最为艰苦的修炼和战斗，孙悟空（野泽雅子暂无内容配音）终于赢得天下第一比武大会冠军，和朋友和家人们过上幸福的生活。但是他的战斗并未中止，邪恶无情的手足同胞拉蒂兹、贝吉塔（堀川りょう暂无内容配音）、那霸先后造访，之后与曾一手毁灭贝吉塔行星的宇宙最大恶魔弗利萨（中尾隆圣暂无内容配音）的宿命决战，再到后来人造人危机以及拥有所有Z战士绝招和不死之身的怪物沙鲁（若本规夫暂无内容配音）。宇宙最强战争不断升级，孙悟空和他的朋友们为了全宇宙的和平勇猛冲锋。久违的《龙珠》故事，焕发耀眼夺目的光彩……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-11-30 11:20:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":98,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QbY5QkYb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3wjope/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe7XnvBa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg2xBjd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmy2L3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqZVPyd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg2xBrd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmy2lRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqZVw7d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7ax1VOlb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dB68lQd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJQYGKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dN0EQ2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdR1M2Vb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QbY5QoAb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3wjBAe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe7XnNQa/index.m3